flowchart TB
    accTitle: One search for every website
    accDescr: Every day, and with every change of main, the Docs workflow builds this website. After the build, the hooks download the search index of each project website at dennis-otto.github.io and turn its entries into excerpts in the folder of the project under its short name. The name of each page gives its entries a rank and a boost, in every language: first the entry of every page, then the sections of the pages that a reader looks for first, such as the installation, the guide and the FAQ, then those of the other pages, and last those of the pages for maintainers, such as the changelog; a decision record keeps its page alone. The projects add 120 KB packed at most: the sections of the pages for maintainers give up their last entries first, the entries of the pages last, before the hooks add them to the search index of this website. A project website that can't be reached is left out until the next build, which still passes. A visitor's search then finds the pages of every project, those that a reader looks for first on top, and opens them on the project's website.

    daily(["Every day at 04:41 UTC<br>the Catalog workflow"])
    push(["A change of main"])
    build["The Docs workflow<br>mkdocs build --strict"]
    indexes["The search index of every project website<br>/homedarts-for-autodarts/search/search_index.json …"]
    hooks[".github/mkdocs_project.py<br>folder · short name · excerpts"]
    subgraph ranks ["Kept first to last, by the name of the page, in every language"]
        r1["1 · the entry of every page"]
        r2["2 · the sections of installation,<br>guide, FAQ … · boost ×2"]
        r3["3 · the sections of the other pages"]
        r4["4 · the sections of changelog,<br>development … · boost ×0.5"]
        never["never · the sections of a decision record,<br>whose page stays · boost ×0.5"]
        r1 --> r2 --> r3 --> r4 --> never
    end
    budget["120 KB packed at most:<br>4 gives up its last entries first, 1 last"]
    away["A website that can't be reached:<br>left out until the next build"]
    index["/search/search_index.json<br>this website and every project"]
    visitor(["A search on dennis-otto.github.io"])
    page["The page on the website of the project"]

    daily & push --> build
    build --> hooks
    indexes --> hooks
    hooks --> ranks --> budget --> index
    hooks -. "download fails" .-> away
    visitor --> index --> page

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class daily,push,build,hooks,r1,r2,r3,r4,budget bot
    class never person
    class visitor,away person
    class index,page done
